  "limitations": [
    "Two clients, two Sibuna workers, GOMAXPROCS=2; loopback HTTP forward-auth, no origin or TLS.",
    "Hashcash work matched at 8 zero bits / 2 zero hex digits; same UA and client IP.",
    "Proof challenges are issued below the 50/s adaptive baseline so the matched work holds; the bootstrap batches above it measure issuance only, which is difficulty independent.",
